WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.192
Musa and his brother Harun bravely went to Pharaoh's palace. Let the Children of Israel go with us!

2
00:00:06.592 --> 00:00:11.704
Proud Pharaoh said, I am the greatest of all! He would not listen.

3
00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:18.536
Musa threw his staff to the ground, and it became a great serpent. His hand shone with pure white light.

4
00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:24.048
Pharaoh would not give in. He gathered the greatest magicians in the land to challenge Musa.

5
00:00:24.448 --> 00:00:31.576
The magicians threw their ropes, which turned into little snakes. But Musa's staff became a great serpent and swallowed them all.

6
00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:39.536
At once the magicians bowed down. We believe in the Lord of all worlds! This was no magic. It was Allah's miracle.

7
00:00:39.936 --> 00:00:47.448
Pharaoh was furious and threatened them, but the magicians were not afraid at all. Those who trust in Allah are the bravest of all.
